<title>Anthropic将Claude Code默认设为自动模式，以保护开发者免受不良审批影响</title>
<link>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-sets-claude-code-to-auto-mode-by-default-to-protect-developers-from-bad-approvals/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://the-decoder.com/?p=38766</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 14:58:57 +0000</pubDate>
